WEBVTT

00:00:02.190 --> 00:00:05.580
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:07.540
This week, it's this!

00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:11.050
It has an effect that deals damage!

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:14.960
It can also Special Summon two copies of it.

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:24.850
There was a mysterious fire in the West 
Fifth District of Neo Domino City yesterday.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:30.080
The Public Maintenance Department 
is investigating the situation.

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:37.000
We received unconfirmed information that 
about 120 people who lived in the area are missing.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:42.180
The young girl rescued from the building fire

00:00:42.180 --> 00:00:47.180
and taken to Domino Hospital 
is still unconscious.

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.390
Congressman, why are you here?

00:00:49.390 --> 00:00:51.460
Are you here to visit the young girl?

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:54.840
How does Congress feel about this 
accident?  Please give us your opinion!

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:56.510
Congressman!

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:18.640
Looking over a vast distance

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:23.740
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:28.650
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:01:29.010 --> 00:01:33.420
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:01:35.280 --> 00:01:38.780
No matter how bad today is

00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:43.770
There’s still the faintest light

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:49.170
All I have to do tomorrow

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:53.230
Is light it myself

00:01:53.540 --> 00:01:58.240
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:03.210
Even if I get countless scars

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:09.510
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:02:09.820 --> 00:02:13.490
Today will never exist again

00:02:13.820 --> 00:02:19.390
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:49.580
Can’t Return to the Past
Closed Door of the Heart

00:02:59.850 --> 00:03:01.130
Aki…

00:03:02.660 --> 00:03:08.660
Isn't it incredible that three 
Signers are in the same place?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:09.750
You're right.

00:03:15.130 --> 00:03:16.610
All that's left is…

00:03:18.480 --> 00:03:19.690
Aki!

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:21.920
Aki!

00:03:24.840 --> 00:03:26.150
Doctor!

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.760
We're her parents.

00:03:29.760 --> 00:03:31.490
How is she?

00:03:32.970 --> 00:03:36.440
We've given her medical treatment, but...

00:03:36.740 --> 00:03:38.030
This way.

00:03:39.190 --> 00:03:41.860
We still haven't seen any response.

00:03:42.220 --> 00:03:45.900
To be honest, she may never 
regain consciousness.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.420
Doctor!

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:49.130
It's all our fault!

00:03:49.130 --> 00:03:51.990
We pushed Aki to this!

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:57.140
Aki, please wake up!  Please 
forgive Papa and Mama!

00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:05.200
Since we're also Signers, isn't 
there anything we can do?

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:08.630
Can't we reach Aki's heart?

00:04:08.630 --> 00:04:12.780
The only thing we have in common is the mark.

00:04:13.300 --> 00:04:18.010
We know nothing about each other, 
and I don't want to get to know her.

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:22.400
But he might…

00:04:28.790 --> 00:04:33.880
There was one person who 
was able to open her heart.

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:36.140
Who... was it?

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:41.960
Yusei Fudo.

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:03.020
It's back to normal.

00:05:03.410 --> 00:05:05.700
Yeah, the D-Wheel.

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:09.160
But you're not.

00:05:09.650 --> 00:05:10.810
How did it go?

00:05:10.810 --> 00:05:13.100
Your instincts were correct.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:16.060
The Dark Signers were in Neo Domino City.

00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:19.370
This building is the headquarters 
of Arcadia Movement.

00:05:19.650 --> 00:05:21.950
Did they attack Izayoi?

00:05:21.950 --> 00:05:25.430
It appears so.  She was 
taken to the hospital.

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:29.500
Are you worried about her as a 
fellow Signer?  Or as a friend?

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:31.040
As a friend.

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:46.080
But in my current state, 
I'm no help to Izayoi.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:58.600
I'm a Neo Domino City Congressman.

00:05:58.600 --> 00:05:59.930
Actually...

00:06:00.270 --> 00:06:03.890
I'm Hideo Izayoi, Aki Izayoi's father.

00:06:03.890 --> 00:06:06.630
Izayoi's father?

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:09.180
What do you want with me?

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:13.010
I want you to save my daughter Aki!

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:18.940
Aki is unconscious and in a coma.

00:06:19.300 --> 00:06:22.450
She must have battled against a Dark Signer.

00:06:23.260 --> 00:06:25.130
We're her parents, but…

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:28.100
We're her parents, but we're not good enough!

00:06:28.100 --> 00:06:30.870
We can't save her!

00:06:31.160 --> 00:06:32.840
We're not good enough!

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:34.620
Calm down.

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:39.540
If you don't properly explain the 
situation, we can't understand anything!

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:46.640
My wife believes our daughter 
turned out this way because we-

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.900
Not "we."  She says it's my fault.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:54.510
But I did everything I could!  However…

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:00.840
Hey.

00:07:00.840 --> 00:07:04.480
Do I really have to go to that party?

00:07:04.480 --> 00:07:10.330
Yes.  It's sponsored by the Public Maintenance 
Department, so you must attend to further your career.

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.320
Excuse me.

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:17.800
Papa!  Today is Aki's 
birthday, so hurry home.

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.800
I know, Aki.

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.130
Welcome home.

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.620
Where's Aki?

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:35.180
Waiting made her tired.

00:07:40.350 --> 00:07:41.770
I'm sorry.

00:07:52.130 --> 00:07:55.540
I'm sorry.  Today was your important day.

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:13.330
Papa, thank you!  I wanted this deck!

00:08:13.330 --> 00:08:14.500
Isn't that great?

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:18.940
Papa, I love you!  Let's duel together today!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:27.470
Sorry, but I have to leave for an important 
job.  I won't return for a month.

00:08:27.470 --> 00:08:29.330
Professor, we must hurry.

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:30.580
I know.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:34.090
So listen to your mother.

00:08:34.090 --> 00:08:34.910
No.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:37.730
No!  No, Papa!

00:08:37.730 --> 00:08:43.210
You said that we would celebrate my birthday 
together!  You said you'll duel with me!

00:08:43.210 --> 00:08:45.100
I hate you, Papa!

00:08:45.100 --> 00:08:47.040
Aki!

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:54.800
A congressman has a busy life, so I 
didn't have much time to spend with Aki.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:09:01.980
But I tried my best to spend time 
with Aki as much as possible!

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:03.700
Even back then...

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:10.140
I managed to make time to duel 
against Aki, just as she wished.

00:09:10.140 --> 00:09:14.820
I activate my trap.  Due to 
Rose Flame's effect, Papa is…

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:18.430
Hello?

00:09:19.030 --> 00:09:20.610
Yes, I see.

00:09:20.610 --> 00:09:21.960
I'm coming right away.

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:28.560
I'm sorry, Aki.  I have to leave immediately.

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.710
I...  I...

00:09:28.560 --> 00:09:30.850
Aki, be a good girl and wait here.

00:09:30.850 --> 00:09:32.120
Aki?

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:35.950
Rose Flame's effect activates!

00:09:45.910 --> 00:09:48.580
My dear!

00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.890
Aki, what are you?

00:09:54.070 --> 00:09:56.820
What is this?

00:09:58.320 --> 00:10:00.490
Papa, I'm scared!

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:03.140
I'm scared, Papa!

00:10:03.140 --> 00:10:05.460
Don't come near me, Aki!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:09.550
What's that power?  You're a monster!

00:10:10.100 --> 00:10:11.170
Dear!

00:10:11.910 --> 00:10:14.630
Monster…

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.720
I'm sorry, Aki!

00:10:19.160 --> 00:10:20.900
That's not what I meant…

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:31.060
I can never take back what I said.

00:10:49.100 --> 00:10:54.560
I didn't know how to relate to Aki anymore.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:11:00.250
How could I when she had 
that terrifying power?

00:11:05.790 --> 00:11:06.760
Dear!

00:11:09.250 --> 00:11:12.340
Papa, why do you hit me?

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:14.840
Is it because I'm not normal?

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:18.640
Because I'm a monster?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.630
I had no choice.

00:11:22.630 --> 00:11:28.640
Instead of staying with parents who couldn't 
understand her, it would be better for Aki if-

00:11:29.370 --> 00:11:31.430
No, I'm lying.

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:36.610
I forced Aki into Duel Academy!

00:11:36.950 --> 00:11:42.570
However, Aki was still all 
alone because of her power.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:00.940
Cheers.

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:12.230
They're laughing.

00:12:13.340 --> 00:12:18.450
Papa and Mama are enjoying themselves.  
Is it because I'm not around?

00:12:21.370 --> 00:12:22.390
Aki…

00:12:24.240 --> 00:12:27.360
I can't forget the look on Aki's face.

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:33.150
Aki came back because she wanted to see us.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:34.270
However...

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:43.470
Aki!

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:45.220
Aki!

00:12:45.220 --> 00:12:49.800
Papa was laughing, so I'll laugh too.

00:12:49.800 --> 00:12:52.720
I'll release this power and laugh!

00:12:53.000 --> 00:12:55.400
I'll laugh at Papa for fearing my power!

00:13:01.510 --> 00:13:05.240
I attack directly with Violet Witch!

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:10.030
Aki!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:13.320
It's natural for people 
without power, including

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:16.620
your parents, to think that 
your power is horrific.

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:22.160
But since the members of Arcadia 
Movement were also ostracized

00:13:22.160 --> 00:13:27.660
as monsters, we can see that you're 
just a weak and lonely girl.

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:29.090
Divine…

00:13:30.520 --> 00:13:34.690
Stay here.  You'll no longer have 
to think about painful topics.

00:13:34.690 --> 00:13:37.660
I'll think of them for you, Aki.

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:41.270
Just be who you are!

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:43.240
Just stay here.

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:44.740
Divine…

00:13:46.910 --> 00:13:50.870
I should've let Divine continue to guide me.

00:13:51.190 --> 00:13:55.330
I didn't have to think 
about anything.  However…

00:13:56.740 --> 00:14:00.440
Don't let others think for you.  
You have to think for yourself.

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.670
What will a witch like me think about?

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:07.420
As long as Divine guides and 
loves me, that's enough!

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:10.170
You're wrong!  You have to love yourself!

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.500
If I could do that…

00:14:12.770 --> 00:14:14.070
If I could…

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:18.650
I'm in pain because I can't!

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:24.960
Help me…

00:14:28.940 --> 00:14:33.870
My daughter Aki's soul is tightly shut.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:35.840
My voice can't reach her.

00:14:36.250 --> 00:14:39.350
But in my current state, 
I can't save her either.

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:40.620
Please!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:46.890
Jack Atlas told me that you tried 
to save her during the Fortune Cup.

00:14:46.890 --> 00:14:49.310
He said you would be able to save Aki!

00:14:49.310 --> 00:14:53.200
Even if I go, what can I do?

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.530
Please, Yusei!

00:14:56.800 --> 00:15:01.460
Yusei, an important man is begging 
for your help.  Save her.

00:15:02.060 --> 00:15:05.130
I know that you're afraid of Kiryu.

00:15:12.620 --> 00:15:17.090
You're afraid to battle against 
your old friend Kiryu.

00:15:17.090 --> 00:15:21.800
How can you consider him a 
friend if you can't face him?

00:15:22.110 --> 00:15:24.670
Kiryu hates me.  There's 
nothing I can do about that.

00:15:24.670 --> 00:15:26.420
You're clueless!

00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:30.620
The door to your heart is currently shut.

00:15:30.620 --> 00:15:34.590
But your friends will be the 
ones who will open that door!

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:40.110
Friends will knock on that door.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:46.100
And if you hear it, the door may open.

00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:49.130
But first, you have to face your friends.

00:15:49.130 --> 00:15:50.590
Right, Yusei?

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:55.350
Thank you, Yusei!

00:15:55.680 --> 00:15:57.260
Let's go.

00:15:57.260 --> 00:16:00.560
Yusei, you like Aki, don't you?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:01.680
No, you're wrong!

00:16:00.920 --> 00:16:02.660
You don't have to blush.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.780
Go rescue your future wife!

00:16:04.780 --> 00:16:06.380
Wait a sec, Martha!

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:11.590
Even Yusei can't stand up to her.

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:20.760
Yusei!

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.770
This way.

00:16:33.480 --> 00:16:34.880
Izayoi…

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:46.390
Izayoi.

00:16:48.100 --> 00:16:51.380
Yusei, you came to save me?

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:52.180
Aki!

00:16:58.740 --> 00:17:01.110
Why are you here?

00:17:01.110 --> 00:17:05.550
I don't need you anymore!  I have Divine!

00:17:15.330 --> 00:17:18.130
Divine is…

00:17:18.460 --> 00:17:19.720
Gone!

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:22.030
You're a fool.

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:27.200
You're a foolish girl that only 
uses her powers for herself.

00:17:27.500 --> 00:17:31.180
If you never existed, he would still be...

00:17:31.180 --> 00:17:36.970
I don't forgive you!  I came 
back in order to get my revenge!

00:17:38.190 --> 00:17:40.240
Divine told me.

00:17:40.240 --> 00:17:44.680
He said that I no longer needed to 
think!  That he would think for me!

00:17:44.680 --> 00:17:45.910
Izayoi, calm down!

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.010
Divine was...

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:51.810
He gave me what Papa took away from me!

00:17:51.810 --> 00:17:54.520
He gave me a home!

00:17:54.520 --> 00:18:00.180
You came to laugh at me 
because I lost my home!

00:18:00.180 --> 00:18:01.910
In that case...

00:18:02.720 --> 00:18:07.230
I'll once again show you 
the power of a monster!

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:08.720
Aki…

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:12.440
Stop it, Izayoi!  Your father is hurting too!

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:21.260
You said that the Signers… 
that my friends would guide me!

00:18:21.260 --> 00:18:23.740
You're also my enemy!

00:18:25.190 --> 00:18:27.830
You're an enemy who took away my home!

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:33.620
Aki!

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:39.260
I can only reach Izayoi's heart by dueling!

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:45.080
That's right.  We aren't friends!  
It's our destiny to battle!

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:51.040
You're wrong!  This is a duel 
to show that we're friends!

00:18:51.040 --> 00:18:52.420
Bring it!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:53.960
Duel!

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:57.680
My turn.  I summon Evil Thorn!

00:19:00.040 --> 00:19:02.440
Its monster effect activates!

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:11.270
By releasing this monster on my field, 
you take 300 points of damage.

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:12.750
Evil Burst!

00:19:19.120 --> 00:19:20.600
Wow!

00:19:20.600 --> 00:19:22.910
Since she's not allowed to 
attack on the first turn,

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:25.910
she used her monster's effect 
to take away his life points.

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:27.400
That's not all.

00:19:27.690 --> 00:19:34.300
By releasing Evil Thorn, I can Special 
Summon two more Evil Thorns from my deck.

00:19:34.550 --> 00:19:37.230
However, they don't have 
their monster effect.

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:38.810
Thank goodness.

00:19:38.810 --> 00:19:42.040
Yeah.  Yusei won't take 
any more damage for now.

00:19:42.040 --> 00:19:46.720
I activate the spell card Closed 
Plant Gate from my hand!

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:54.480
I can activate it when there are two 
Plant-Type monsters on my field with the same name.

00:19:54.480 --> 00:19:57.940
You're not allowed to 
attack on your next turn.

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:00.690
I end my turn.

00:20:01.190 --> 00:20:02.550
My turn!

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:06.130
I summon Shield Warrior in defense position!

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:14.140
His opponent's monsters only have 100 
attack points, but he can't attack.

00:20:14.140 --> 00:20:17.020
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:18.900
My turn!

00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:22.950
I summon the Tuner Monster 
Twilight Rose Knight!

00:20:26.160 --> 00:20:27.640
Is she going to do it?

00:20:27.640 --> 00:20:31.580
Due to Twilight Rose Knight's 
effect, I can Special

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:35.780
Summon one Level 4-or-below 
Plant-Type monster from my hand!

00:20:36.130 --> 00:20:38.210
Come, Dark Verger!

00:20:39.830 --> 00:20:41.640
Four monsters…

00:20:41.640 --> 00:20:48.900
Level 3 Twilight Rose Knight tunes two Level 
1 Evil Thorns and Level 2 Dark Verger.

00:20:48.900 --> 00:20:51.330
What's one plus one plus two plus three?

00:20:51.330 --> 00:20:52.530
It's seven.

00:20:53.380 --> 00:20:55.380
Black Rose Dragon.

00:20:59.040 --> 00:21:04.910
The cold flame envelops the entire 
world.  Black flower, bloom!

00:21:04.910 --> 00:21:06.820
Synchro Summon!

00:21:06.820 --> 00:21:10.390
Appear, Black Rose Dragon!

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:17.830
She brought Black Rose Dragon out quickly!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:20.300
She's seriously trying to defeat Yusei!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:23.940
Then I activate the Equip 
Spell Thorn of Malice!

00:21:24.230 --> 00:21:29.260
The equipped monster gains 600 attack points!

00:21:34.780 --> 00:21:36.040
Aki…

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:41.120
Papa, your eyes are the same as before.

00:21:41.120 --> 00:21:43.960
Those eyes look like they're 
staring at a monster!

00:21:43.960 --> 00:21:45.420
Izayoi!

00:21:45.860 --> 00:21:49.520
I'll make you feel the 
same pain I felt, Yusei.

00:21:49.520 --> 00:21:56.930
If I no longer have the home that Divine gave 
me, then I'll destroy all the homes in the world!

00:22:14.030 --> 00:22:18.500
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.860 --> 00:22:23.570
We will build our own future

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:29.010
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:29.470 --> 00:22:34.180
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:39.780 --> 00:22:49.320
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:49.760 --> 00:22:54.900
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:59.600
Even if it loses its light

00:23:00.070 --> 00:23:04.870
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.870 --> 00:23:09.340
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

